  "notes": "STRUCTURE ONLY. Same schema as codes/ipc-2021.json so one set of rule code can read either, and every number null so neither can ever be answered with the other book. UPC and IPC disagree on fixture unit values for the same fixture; a total built from the wrong book is the wrong pipe size.",
